{"author":{"id":"dec876858d28babbadcead4137861bf586626b8518cbce9c5f4fc52ac3b424b8"},"ops":[{"type":3,"timestamp":1791028970,"nonce":"525lKOU5gG5rg+r0JDAIU4/wNA4=","message":"The requester withdrew this: ashui will support full SVG, text included, so it no longer wants to drop fontdb.\n\nLeaving it OPEN, because it does not depend on that caller. The measurement stands on its own: around 600 KB of 3 MiB of release code is blinc_svg's dependency tree, and Blinc ships to wasm and mobile where that is worth something. Nothing in this repo's icon sets uses \u003ctext\u003e, so an embedder that also avoids it pays for fontdb and system-font loading for nothing.\n\nWhoever triages this should feel free to close it if binary size is not a priority; it is a size optimisation with no correctness angle, and no caller is now waiting on it.","files":null}]}